{"data":[{"author_id":"232201624","created_at":"2026-10-25T06:34:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114244171305451798"],"id":"2114244171305451798","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":18094,"like_count":64,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":10},"text":"然而中国人都认为中国像菜市场一样的医院是物廉价美，世界第一。 https://t.co/GDnwLoi1XZ","url":"https://x.com/fangshimin/status/2114244171305451798"},{"author_id":"1072109417200414720","created_at":"2026-10-25T06:33:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114243859651949024"],"id":"2114243859651949024","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":41447,"like_count":95,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":32,"retweet_count":2},"text":"央视报道金正恩访问丹东。这次访问，比较像丹东大桥通车仪式的一部分，体现朝鲜对中国关系进一步恢复和加强的姿态。 https://t.co/n6BxE6XUEN","url":"https://x.com/wangzhian8848/status/2114243859651949024"},{"author_id":"39941478","created_at":"2026-10-25T06:32:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114243728177074480"],"id":"2114243728177074480","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":20064,"like_count":61,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":4},"text":"美国前总统奥巴马10月24日在俄亥俄州为民主党候选人站台，猛烈抨击总统特朗普执政两年来造成“混乱、残酷、腐败和无能”的局面，呼吁选民在11月3日中期选举中通过选票表达不满。 https://t.co/53ISLlTv1q","url":"https://x.com/zaobaosg/status/2114243728177074480"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-25T06:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114243057784881350"],"id":"2114243057784881350","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":53,"impression_count":75208,"like_count":493,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":97,"retweet_count":33},"text":"“剩下5块钱可以自由消费”\n\n10月23日，有网友晒出温州一家烤肉店员工计算3200月薪扣除各项开销后的余额，只剩下5元。\n\n评论区有网友按视频中的计算给“翻译”了一下：“3200的工资，减1600的房费，减500的水电，减320的生活费，减80的话费，600块打家里。天冷了，95加套秋裤。还剩下5块钱可以自由消费。” https://t.co/cX13z6fcrj","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2114243057784881350"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-25T06:14:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114239043848344031"],"id":"2114239043848344031","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3929,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":2},"text":"相恋8年没娶成，认识4个月就奉子成婚。\n\n乔振宇分手时，对王丽坤说了一句：“但凡你有一点想和我结婚的意思，我们也不至于走到这一步”\n\n两人是拍《七剑下天山》演情侣演出来的感情，戏里戏外一谈就是8年。\n\n这8年里乔振宇求了好几次婚，王丽坤每次都是同一句：等事业稳定了再说。","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2114239043848344031"},{"author_id":"232201624","created_at":"2026-10-25T06:09:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114237886929551798"],"id":"2114237886929551798","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":7325,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"发表新文章《高中预修微积分对申请美国大学的影响》 https://t.co/LecRtbB8Id","url":"https://x.com/fangshimin/status/2114237886929551798"},{"author_id":"39941478","created_at":"2026-10-25T06:03:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114236372382859709"],"id":"2114236372382859709","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":10434,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"巴勒斯坦武装分子袭击并打死两名以色列士兵的隔天，以色列军方在被占领的约旦河西岸城市希伯伦（Hebron）展开军事行动，导致约1200名巴勒斯坦人被迫离开家园。 https://t.co/cOd7axv5C3","url":"https://x.com/zaobaosg/status/2114236372382859709"},{"author_id":"46574977","created_at":"2026-10-25T06:00:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114235639910613366"],"id":"2114235639910613366","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":12667,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#本周热读 最新披露的信息显示，Anthropic的收入正迅猛增长，但该公司在筹备IPO之际，也面临诸多风险，包括客户群体狭窄，以及能否获得急需的算力仍存在不确定性。https://t.co/rsKSDPH3Hv","url":"https://x.com/ChineseWSJ/status/2114235639910613366"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-25T06:00:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114235510000640057"],"id":"2114235510000640057","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":43,"impression_count":43281,"like_count":183,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":23},"text":"内蒙古大学请警察讲反翻墙，要求杜绝传播翻墙渠道\n\n10月20日，内蒙古大学经济管理学院邀请呼和浩特市公安局王警官，面向全院师生代表开展反翻墙讲座。学院发布的报道要求师生“杜绝私自翻墙、传播翻墙渠道等违规行为”。 https://t.co/reap6NOkWy https://t.co/qY5zHQNwuV","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2114235510000640057"},{"author_id":"232201624","created_at":"2026-10-25T05:44:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114231570731323537"],"id":"2114231570731323537","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4838,"like_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"艾奥瓦共和党副州长候选人Wulf被8人或公司起诉欠债，现在又多了两个债主：他的父母。他的父母起诉他2年前起就欠下租种的农田租金，共27.5万美元。他本来也当选不了。共和党州长候选人目前落后民主党11点，而川普在2024年在艾奥瓦赢了13点，并支持该候选人。可见这俩候选人有多烂，典型玛噶。 https://t.co/O3ZdkPEG69","url":"https://x.com/fangshimin/status/2114231570731323537"},{"author_id":"1416680666184306689","created_at":"2026-10-25T05:44:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114231496089428020"],"id":"2114231496089428020","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4003,"like_count":5,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Claude Code 两名核心成员相继离职\n\nAnthropic旗下AI编程工具Claude Code的两名核心成员，近日相继宣布离职。\n\nThariq参与Claude https://t.co/mkxSQfZmc4","url":"https://x.com/PANewsCN/status/2114231496089428020"},{"author_id":"1521688129559613440","created_at":"2026-10-25T05:40:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114230677604557136"],"id":"2114230677604557136","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":25,"impression_count":14129,"like_count":153,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":3},"text":"给关注者比较多的小伙伴一些建议。\n\n假如你以后想做自己的独立产品，那就不太建议你去接商单，一方面这可能是你未来用户不喜欢的点，另一方面会让你感觉还是自媒体来钱快，可能弄独立开发就坚持不下去了。 https://t.co/d4S5IRh4RT","url":"https://x.com/HiTw93/status/2114230677604557136"},{"author_id":"1338075202798809089","created_at":"2026-10-25T05:38:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114230068096438483"],"id":"2114230068096438483","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":46306,"like_count":94,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":27,"retweet_count":6},"text":"中期选举提前投票已经开始，截至今天最新关键摇摆州之一亚利桑那州共投了884,474张选票：邮寄884,474张，亲自投0张。注册的民主党人投了38.7%，注册的共和党人投了38.4%。亚利桑那州最大县马里科帕县：共和党已微弱领先（约38.4% vs 民主党38.3%）。近期每日返回批次明显偏向共和党。 https://t.co/cjDEwucIUL https://t.co/U3UHKI9pN2","url":"https://x.com/qinbafrank/status/2114230068096438483"},{"author_id":"1416680666184306689","created_at":"2026-10-25T05:38:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114229998005719107"],"id":"2114229998005719107","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4079,"like_count":14,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":5},"text":"美国从荷兰引渡一名中国籍男子，涉柬埔寨诈骗园区洗钱超3690万美元\n\n据美国司法部消息，44岁中国籍男子Zheng Zhao被从荷兰引渡至美国，10月23日在加州联邦法院出庭，被控参与洗钱共谋，最高可判20年。此案已有8名同伙认罪。 https://t.co/xA0NZ3lvBo","url":"https://x.com/PANewsCN/status/2114229998005719107"},{"author_id":"1669276256","created_at":"2026-10-25T05:34:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114229075514651001"],"id":"2114229075514651001","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":8769,"like_count":18,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":1},"text":"Notion 这个在 iPhone Duo 上的适配相当不错。\n\n我现在很多让 Grok bot 和 Muse 生成的内容 都会让它直接发到 Notion 里我去读。 https://t.co/71aP4j6od4","url":"https://x.com/op7418/status/2114229075514651001"},{"author_id":"39941478","created_at":"2026-10-25T05:33:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114228962482126911"],"id":"2114228962482126911","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":20358,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"妻子在毫不知情下“被当老板”？一名56岁男子被指把公司物流业务当成“私人提款机”，在妻子毫不知情下，以她的名字注册独资企业，再凭128张从未提供物流服务的虚假发票，在约六年内让公司估计损失超过200万元。 https://t.co/OTVoBtAhWU","url":"https://x.com/zaobaosg/status/2114228962482126911"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-25T05:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114227959166853501"],"id":"2114227959166853501","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":49,"impression_count":61675,"like_count":158,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":30,"retweet_count":10},"text":"被捧为“十篇SCI大神”，医学博士生在综艺考核中“盲猜”病情\n\n10月22日，《令人心动的offer8》医学生李子祺“盲猜”病情的话题登上热搜。\n节目官博此前以“参与四级手术、手握十篇SCI”宣传这名福建医科大学神经外科博士生，称其“临床科研双开花”。 https://t.co/IPbe1ohJIi","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2114227959166853501"},{"author_id":"168139512","created_at":"2026-10-25T05:26:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114227016153354463"],"id":"2114227016153354463","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4872,"like_count":4,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"text":"外事不决问 ChatGPT\n内事不决问 DeepSeek https://t.co/db7Emsxsdc","url":"https://x.com/geekbb/status/2114227016153354463"},{"author_id":"232201624","created_at":"2026-10-25T05:13:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114223865597726876"],"id":"2114223865597726876","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":17743,"like_count":32,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":5},"text":"苏州市委书记和谷爱凌亲切交谈。 https://t.co/1UZb669dHO","url":"https://x.com/fangshimin/status/2114223865597726876"},{"author_id":"39941478","created_at":"2026-10-25T05:04:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114221474487677215"],"id":"2114221474487677215","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":19368,"like_count":18,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":2},"text":"随着与美国的战争带来日益沉重的经济压力，伊朗总统佩泽希齐扬坦言，许多伊朗人正为一日三餐的温饱问题苦苦挣扎。 https://t.co/DUiyFLC0Ms","url":"https://x.com/zaobaosg/status/2114221474487677215"},{"author_id":"46574977","created_at":"2026-10-25T05:00:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114220502856122775"],"id":"2114220502856122775","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":14648,"like_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"#本周热读 知情人士称，DeepSeek已通过第二轮私募融资筹得150亿美元。知情人士称，这家中国AI初创公司目标是明年初在上海上市，可能先于OpenAI和月之暗面进行IPO。https://t.co/YYF0N8itB7","url":"https://x.com/ChineseWSJ/status/2114220502856122775"},{"author_id":"121908437","created_at":"2026-10-25T05:00:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114220429938499719"],"id":"2114220429938499719","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":5115,"like_count":19,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":0},"text":"演示一下我是如何轻松决策要不要拉黑一个 AI 回复的。\n\n目前我的 Grok Bot 会每隔 15 分钟扫一遍我的回复区域，遇到疑似 AI 回复的，它会继续把这个账号最近的十条给别人的回复拉出来看看是否符合一定规定，也会展示给我看。\n\n我只要看看这个整理好的表格，确定是 AI https://t.co/M5VrcwsWxf","url":"https://x.com/tualatrix/status/2114220429938499719"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-25T05:00:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114220410279477491"],"id":"2114220410279477491","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":22,"impression_count":44204,"like_count":216,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":26,"retweet_count":9},"text":"10月23日，网友发现，问界汽车小红书官方账号关闭了评论区艾特（@）功能。用户在尝试提及“@问界汽车”时，平台系统弹窗提示“用户已关闭评论艾特”。\n\n这一情况引发网友调侃：\n“这真有点逆天了，品牌方不让艾特”\n“为所欲为”\n“烧的就是快让你们永远追不上”\n“一千万以内最燃的SUV，没有之一” https://t.co/B4Vj8h21u0 https://t.co/pBhFbrMfSR","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2114220410279477491"},{"author_id":"2786701","created_at":"2026-10-25T04:52:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114218437698613274"],"id":"2114218437698613274","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":5428,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"一个Seedance制作的AI短片，效果真棒，片名：《怪奇世界》系列剧-它在门外（OPEN UP），万圣节深夜，门外一直有人在敲。它说：“是我，快开门。”  https://t.co/HAEK3MiwZH","url":"https://x.com/williamlong/status/2114218437698613274"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-25T04:49:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114217645222273058"],"id":"2114217645222273058","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3614,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":0},"text":"刚被一个小网友气得不轻，缠着我聊了半天\n郑州的大二学生退学，出来专职做推特，要拜我为师😢\n他才三千多粉丝，连创作者收益资格都没有\n\n孩子，你这是听谁忽悠的？这种事情要随缘\n有今天没明天的，当个爱好玩玩没问题\n拿它当饭碗，你太天真了～😓","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2114217645222273058"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"232201624","name":"方舟子","username":"fangshimin"